{"id":"steam-1030460","steam":1030460,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Hulala Baby","summary":"Hulala Baby, is a leisure game. It tells the story of the heroine's growth from childhood to adulthood. During her growth, she met many interesting people and things.","about":"In a certain country on the Eurasian continent, there is a deep forest...\r\nIn the depths of this forest, there is a small village.\r\nHere are the simple and kind people who live a carefree life.\r\nThere is a little girl in the village, her name is \"Hulala\".\r\nThe adults in the village are used to calling her \"Lulala\".\r\nIn the eyes of everyone, Hullala is a child living in a fairy tale.\r\nShe is innocent and lively, full of strange ideas every day.\r\nEspecially at night, Xiao Di, after sleeping, often dreams.\r\nThere are always a lot of \"food\" in the dream!\r\nuntil one day...\r\nShe dreamed of something...\r\nThis calm life has begun to undergo subtle changes...\r\n\r\n Game features：\r\n\n• Players need to operate a cute girl to work and live in the game world. Each time you complete a task, you can move to the next level and discover new scenes, and the story will continue. \n\r\n\n• Cards（Coming Soon）\n\r\nOperation method：\r\n\n• 1.Mouse、Keyboard：↑Up、↓Down、←Left、→Right，move\n\r\n\n• 2.Spacebar、Enter：Next Page、Confirm \n\r\n\n• 3.Esc：Return、Open Menu","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030460/portrait.png?t=1566635993","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030460/header.jpg?t=1566635993","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030460/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1566635993","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030460/header.jpg?t=1566635993","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030460/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1566635993","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.